@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix f5:   <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/fortune5-architecture#> .

f5:EnterpriseArchitectureProgram a rdfs:Class .
f5:ArchitectureAsset a rdfs:Class .
f5:EnterpriseCapability a rdfs:Class .
f5:Region a rdfs:Class .
